From 8a6331ba7a4ac55a14ad0e3b2304359dfe921b98 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Wed, 17 Jun 2026 01:18:13 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 02225/11362] [outer-loop] E1 lands +3 new games (cn04, m0r0,
 sk48) -> 13 reproduced levels/11 games

The salience-ordering + HUD-masking explorer upgrade (E1) cracked three games that
were NO-ADVANCE in the pre-E1 4000-budget sweep. All independently re-gated
reproduced=True L1. Metaharness independently confirms total=13 across 11 games.
Registry + aggregate scorecard updated. tn36 still errors (its ACTION6 click schema
-- per-game delta, unaffected by candidate ordering).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
